---
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Specializations - Untamed</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="container">
				<a href="/" class="logo">UNTAMED</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="/rules">Rules</a>
					<a href="/quick-reference">Quick Reference</a>
					<a href="/character" class="active">Characters</a>
					<a href="/bestiary">Bestiary</a>
					<a href="/gm-guide">GM Guide</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/character">← Back to Character Creation</a>
					<span style="margin: 0 8px; color: var(--earth-brown);">·</span>
					<a href="/character/roster">View Your Hunters</a>
				</div>

				<header class="page-header">
					<h1>Specializations</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">Big playstyle shifts — earned every 10 Hunter Ranks</p>
				</header>

				<article class="content">
					<section class="intro-section">
						<div class="info-box">
							<p>Specializations are major build-defining upgrades that push your hunter into a defined direction. Choose <strong>1 Specialization every 10 Hunter Ranks</strong>. Each has 3 ranks of increasing power.</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="spec-grid">
						<!-- Juggernaut -->
						<details class="spec-card">
							<summary>
								<div class="spec-header">
									<span class="spec-icon">🛡️</span>
									<div class="spec-title">
										<h3>Juggernaut</h3>
										<span class="spec-role">Tank</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="spec-quote">"The best offense is a fortress of steel."</p>
							</summary>
							<div class="spec-details">
								<div class="rank-list">
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Core Passive</span>
										<h4>Iron Reprisal</h4>
										<p>When you Block and reduce damage to half, the attacker takes damage equal to your CON modifier (once per attacker per round).</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 2</span>
										<h4>Plate Angles</h4>
										<p>+1 AR permanently.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 3</span>
										<h4>Steadfast</h4>
										<p>You may regain 1d12 health after taking a lethal blow. Once per hunt.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="best-with">
									<strong>Best with:</strong> Greatshield, Spear & Shield, Hammer
								</div>
							</div>
						</details>

						<!-- Deadeye -->
						<details class="spec-card">
							<summary>
								<div class="spec-header">
									<span class="spec-icon">🎯</span>
									<div class="spec-title">
										<h3>Deadeye</h3>
										<span class="spec-role">Ranged</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="spec-quote">"One shot, one kill."</p>
							</summary>
							<div class="spec-details">
								<div class="rank-list">
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Core Passive</span>
										<h4>Stable Platform</h4>
										<p>If you moved 5 ft or less, your ranged attacks ignore long-range disadvantage and gain +1 to hit.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 2</span>
										<h4>Marked Precision</h4>
										<p>If you Aim (skip movement and Fast Actions this turn), your next Called Shot next turn does not suffer disadvantage and gains +1 Power Die.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 3</span>
										<h4>Perfect Focus</h4>
										<p>1/hunt: Treat your next ranged attack as a guaranteed hit (cannot crit), or if it would already hit, add +2 Power Dice instead.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="best-with">
									<strong>Best with:</strong> Bow, Arbalest
								</div>
							</div>
						</details>

						<!-- Warblade -->
						<details class="spec-card">
							<summary>
								<div class="spec-header">
									<span class="spec-icon">⚔️</span>
									<div class="spec-title">
										<h3>Warblade</h3>
										<span class="spec-role">Aggressive Melee</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="spec-quote">"Turn every strike into an opening."</p>
							</summary>
							<div class="spec-details">
								<div class="rank-list">
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Core Passive</span>
										<h4>Opening Cut</h4>
										<p>If you Dodge successfully or Parry and Riposte, you gain 1 Free Attack (0 Stamina, basic attack only; 1/round).</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 2</span>
										<h4>Rolling Pressure</h4>
										<p>After you land a Free Attack, your next attack this round gets +2 to hit.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 3</span>
										<h4>Bloodthirst</h4>
										<p>1/hunt window: For 2 rounds, on each critical hit, regain Stamina equal to your weapon's main stat mod (min 1).</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="best-with">
									<strong>Best with:</strong> Claws, Greatsword, Whip, Spear & Shield (Assault)
								</div>
							</div>
						</details>

						<!-- Elementalist -->
						<details class="spec-card">
							<summary>
								<div class="spec-header">
									<span class="spec-icon">🔥</span>
									<div class="spec-title">
										<h3>Elementalist</h3>
										<span class="spec-role">Imbue</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="spec-quote">"Master the forces of nature."</p>
							</summary>
							<div class="spec-details">
								<div class="rank-list">
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Core Passive</span>
										<h4>Elemental Imbuement</h4>
										<p>Toggle: Imbue your weapon with an element you know. Your first hit each turn gains that element's Tier-1 rider (e.g., Fire: +1 fire die; Ice: apply Chilled on failed CON save; Lightning: +1 chain jump on failed DEX save). Costs 1 Stamina/turn to maintain.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 2</span>
										<h4>Extended Channel</h4>
										<p>While Imbued, +10 ft reach on melee elemental riders or +20 ft range for ranged elemental riders (doesn't extend the weapon's physical reach, just the rider effect).</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 3</span>
										<h4>Overcharge</h4>
										<p>1/hunt: End your Imbuement to create a 10-ft burst centered on your target (or on you): deal 2x your basic attack's element dice to hostiles; riders apply once. You lose the Imbuement until end of fight or Downtime.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="best-with">
									<strong>Best with:</strong> Wand, Hunting Flute, Claws, Spear & Shield
								</div>
							</div>
						</details>

						<!-- Monster Butcher -->
						<details class="spec-card">
							<summary>
								<div class="spec-header">
									<span class="spec-icon">💀</span>
									<div class="spec-title">
										<h3>Monster Butcher</h3>
										<span class="spec-role">Executioner</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="spec-quote">"Hunt with precision, kill without mercy."</p>
							</summary>
							<div class="spec-details">
								<div class="rank-list">
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Core Passive</span>
										<h4>Mercy's Edge</h4>
										<p>Against foes at 50% HP or below, you deal +2 damage and your attacks against broken parts gain +1 Power Die.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 2</span>
										<h4>Part Mastery</h4>
										<p>When you hit a broken part, deal +2 additional damage and the target makes a CON save vs your DC or Bleed.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 3</span>
										<h4>Deathblow</h4>
										<p>1/hunt: Against a target at 10% HP or below, make a Deathblow attack. On hit, the target makes a CON save vs your DC. Fail: slain. Success: takes 3x your weapon dice instead.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="best-with">
									<strong>Best with:</strong> Greatsword, Spear & Shield
								</div>
							</div>
						</details>

						<!-- Evasive Phantom -->
						<details class="spec-card">
							<summary>
								<div class="spec-header">
									<span class="spec-icon">💨</span>
									<div class="spec-title">
										<h3>Evasive Phantom</h3>
										<span class="spec-role">Speed / Position</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="spec-quote">"Miss me? Catch me."</p>
							</summary>
							<div class="spec-details">
								<div class="rank-list">
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Core Passive</span>
										<h4>Slipstream</h4>
										<p>When an enemy misses you with an attack, you may move up to 10 ft (no OAs from that attacker). 1/turn.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 2</span>
										<h4>Ghost Counter</h4>
										<p>After a successful Dodge, your next attack before end of your next turn gets +2 to hit and +1 Power Die.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 3</span>
										<h4>Shadow Step</h4>
										<p>1/hunt: Negate one entire incoming attack sequence (multi-hit) with no Stamina cost, then reposition up to your Speed.</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="best-with">
									<strong>Best with:</strong> Boomerang, Claws, Whip, Bow
								</div>
							</div>
						</details>

						<!-- Tactician -->
						<details class="spec-card">
							<summary>
								<div class="spec-header">
									<span class="spec-icon">🎭</span>
									<div class="spec-title">
										<h3>Tactician</h3>
										<span class="spec-role">Support / Control</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<p class="spec-quote">"Win the hunt before it begins."</p>
							</summary>
							<div class="spec-details">
								<div class="rank-list">
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Core Passive</span>
										<h4>Command Prep</h4>
										<p>Once each turn, you may take one Preparation Action that does not replace your Action.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 2</span>
										<h4>Plan Ahead</h4>
										<p>Choose one ally within 30 ft; until the start of your next turn, they gain +1 to their next attack or defense roll. If you used Command Prep this turn, that ally may also move up to 5 ft without provoking.</p>
									</div>
									<div class="rank-item">
										<span class="rank-label">Rank 3</span>
										<h4>Mastermind</h4>
										<p>1/hunt: Pick one visible monster — the GM reveals its next intended action/target. Then choose one: <strong>Initiative Swap</strong> (swap initiative of two allies this round) or <strong>Prep Surge</strong> (one ally within 30 ft immediately takes a Preparation Action).</p>
									</div>
								</div>
								<div class="best-with">
									<strong>Best with:</strong> Whip, Hunting Flute, Conduit
								</div>
							</div>
						</details>
					</section>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<style>
			* {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			:root {
				--forest-dark: #1a2e1a;
				--forest-green: #2d5016;
				--moss-green: #4a7c2f;
				--leaf-green: #6b9d3a;
				--amber: #d4a257;
				--earth-brown: #5c4033;
				--cream: #f5f1e8;
				--text-light: #e8e4d8;
			}

			body {
				font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif;
				background: var(--forest-dark);
				color: var(--text-light);
				line-height: 1.6;
				min-height: 100vh;
			}

			.container {
				max-width: 1200px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 0 2rem;
			}

			.nav {
				background: var(--forest-green);
				border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber);
				padding: 1rem 0;
				position: sticky;
				top: 0;
				z-index: 100;
			}

			.nav .container {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: center;
			}

			.logo {
				font-size: 1.5rem;
				font-weight: 900;
				color: var(--amber);
				text-decoration: none;
				letter-spacing: 0.2rem;
			}

			.nav-links {
				display: flex;
				gap: 2rem;
			}

			.nav-links a {
				color: var(--cream);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: 500;
				transition: color 0.3s;
			}

			.nav-links a:hover,
			.nav-links a.active {
				color: var(--amber);
			}

			.breadcrumb {
				padding: 1.5rem 0 0;
			}

			.breadcrumb a {
				color: var(--leaf-green);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}

			.breadcrumb a:hover {
				color: var(--amber);
			}

			.page-header {
				padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
				text-align: center;
				border-bottom: 2px solid var(--earth-brown);
				margin-bottom: 3rem;
			}

			.page-header h1 {
				font-size: 3rem;
				color: var(--amber);
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.subtitle {
				font-size: 1.2rem;
				color: var(--leaf-green);
				font-style: italic;
			}

			.content {
				padding-bottom: 4rem;
			}

			.intro-section {
				margin-bottom: 2rem;
			}

			.info-box {
				background: var(--forest-green);
				border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown);
				border-radius: 12px;
				padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
				font-size: 1.05rem;
			}

			.spec-grid {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 1rem;
			}

			.spec-card {
				background: var(--forest-green);
				border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown);
				border-radius: 12px;
				overflow: hidden;
				transition: border-color 0.3s;
			}

			.spec-card[open] {
				border-color: var(--amber);
			}

			.spec-card summary {
				cursor: pointer;
				padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
				list-style: none;
			}

			.spec-card summary::-webkit-details-marker {
				display: none;
			}

			.spec-header {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 1rem;
				margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
			}

			.spec-icon {
				font-size: 1.8rem;
			}

			.spec-title {
				display: flex;
				align-items: baseline;
				gap: 0.75rem;
			}

			.spec-title h3 {
				color: var(--cream);
				font-size: 1.3rem;
			}

			.spec-role {
				color: var(--leaf-green);
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				font-style: italic;
			}

			.spec-quote {
				color: var(--amber);
				font-style: italic;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				padding-left: 3.5rem;
			}

			.spec-details {
				padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--earth-brown);
				padding-top: 1.5rem;
			}

			.rank-list {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 1rem;
				margin-bottom: 1rem;
			}

			.rank-item {
				background: var(--forest-dark);
				border: 1px solid var(--moss-green);
				border-radius: 8px;
				padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
			}

			.rank-label {
				display: inline-block;
				background: var(--moss-green);
				color: var(--cream);
				font-size: 0.7rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				letter-spacing: 0.05rem;
				padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
				border-radius: 4px;
				margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
			}

			.rank-item h4 {
				color: var(--amber);
				font-size: 1rem;
				margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
			}

			.rank-item p {
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				line-height: 1.5;
			}

			.best-with {
				background: var(--forest-dark);
				border: 1px solid var(--earth-brown);
				border-radius: 8px;
				padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				color: var(--leaf-green);
			}

			.best-with strong {
				color: var(--cream);
			}

			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.page-header h1 {
					font-size: 2rem;
				}

				.spec-title {
					flex-direction: column;
					gap: 0.2rem;
				}

				.spec-quote {
					padding-left: 0;
				}

				.nav-links {
					gap: 1rem;
					font-size: 0.85rem;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
